codex
The failure is caused by this container denying Lean/Lake’s own `/proc/<pid>/exe` lookup; direct binary and proxy invocations both fail before elaboration. I found a narrow workaround: an audit-local preload shim that answers only that self-executable lookup from the kernel’s `AT_EXECFN` value, leaving all files and Lean semantics untouched. I’ll record the shim and retry the exact trusted preflight with the pinned toolchain.
